    "bestTime": "Mornings, when the harbour is calmest. Sydney By Kayak runs most tours before midday because of boat traffic, chop and afternoon heat.",
    "hours": "Booked tours only. Highlights tour from 9:30am (allow 1.5 hrs, 60 min on the water); Harbour Bridge tour from 10am (allow 2 hrs). Sunrise tours start pre-dawn; kayak and gelato tours leave at 1pm or 4pm; sunset tours run in the evening.",
