    "facilities": [
      "Accessible toilet near the boat ramp, and another at the SBK Eco Hub, 208 Blues Point Rd",
      "No shed or lockers at the ramp: it's a mobile operation"
    ],
    "access": "Sydney By Kayak lists a step-free route and an accessible toilet at the meeting point. With notice it offers an adaptive outrigger kayak (up to about 120 kg), help with transfers and an extra guide.",
    "safety": [
      "Ages 8 and up; under-15s must paddle with a parent or guardian aged 18 or over",
      "Weight limit 110 kg per kayak",
      "Life jackets and a safety briefing are included, and guides can tow tired paddlers",
      "The Harbour Bridge tour crosses ferry lanes: you should have paddled at least once before",
      "Tours are called off for storms or unsafe conditions (store credit, a new date or a 90% refund)"
